# Large regeneratable feature/derived-data tables (rebuild via
# 02_phase2_feature_extraction/ and the relevant experiment's build
# script) -- NOT split-index / results_*.csv files, those stay tracked.
# Added 2026-07-30 after the concurrency_src_1s rollout (see
# 10_final_report/CHANGELOG.md) to keep future regenerated tables out of
# the repo; files matching these patterns already committed before this
# date are unaffected (.gitignore is forward-looking only).
**/features_all_windows.csv
**/features_v2_all_rows.csv
**/concurrency_features_all_rows.csv
**/iat_feature_all_rows.csv
**/by_window/*.csv
experiments/v2_ip_aggregation_rejected/**/*.csv
*.parquet

# Raw dataset safety net -- already lives outside this repo, at ../data/
ids-dataset-raw*/
ids-dataset-features/

# V1_ARCHIVE/ (2026-07-30 v1->v2 rollout archive, 18M as of this date) --
# forward-looking only: already-committed contents stay in git history,
# this just stops NEW files added under V1_ARCHIVE/ from being tracked.
V1_ARCHIVE/
